        "physical_examination[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Taking everything into account, my working impression is an underactive thyroid. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I'd also keep depression in mind. Let's book a thyroid test to look into hypothyroid symptoms. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. Let's book blood tests to look into fatigue.",
